{"meta":{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","type":"tv","name":"Sensing Murder","logo":"https://i.imgur.com/HYEABSt.png","poster":"https://i.imgur.com/HYEABSt.png","posterShape":"square","genres":["English Docs & Lifestyle"],"channelNumber":783,"behaviorHints":{"isLive":true,"defaultVideoId":"ftv_SensingMurder_us"},"videos":[{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder – Live","released":"2026-11-28T00:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T00:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder – Live","released":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder – Live","released":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T08:35:45Z","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Lost Soul","released":"2026-11-28T08:35:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T08:35:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T09:24:45Z","overview":"In 1985, 25-year-old Luana 'La Verne' Williams disappeared from her Tauranga home. Eight years later her disappearance was upgraged to a murder enquiry. Her body has never been found.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Walk of Innocence","released":"2026-11-28T09:24:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T09:24:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T10:14:45Z","overview":"In 1970, eighteen-year-old Olive Waiker disappeared as she walked across Rotorua to babysit her nieces and nephews. Her semi-naked body was found hours later in a rest area south of the city..","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Now You See Me","released":"2026-11-28T10:14:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T10:14:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T11:06:45Z","overview":"26-year-old deaf woman Alexa Cullen vanished from her home in Manaia, on the Coromandel Peninsular in 1995. She had a history of hitch-hiking and police suspected she’d run away. But three years later, ominous rumors began circulating in the community.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Sensing Murder Insights - Special","released":"2026-11-28T11:06:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T11:06:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T12:24:45Z","overview":"Police detectives from around New Zealand reveal exciting new developments sparked by the Sensing Murder psychics in Series 1.","genres":["Series","Faith & Spirituality"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Girl in The Ditch","released":"2026-11-28T12:24:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:24:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:14:45Z","overview":"When 12 year old Agnes Ali'iva'a drowned in a ditch in 1992, the police initially thought her death was accidental. It was four years before public and political pressure forced police to re-investigate her death.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder","released":"2026-11-28T13:14:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:14:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:54:45Z","overview":"“Sensing Murder” psychics are challenged to connect with the spirit of murdered Christchurch scrap-metal dealer, John Reynolds, to discover his killer and reveal the truth surrounding the violent attack.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Seeking Siegfried","released":"2026-11-28T14:54:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:54:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:09:45Z","overview":"Katikati man Siegfried Newman disappeared on February 25, 2008, after he had dropped his sons Thomas, 9, and Oliver, 7, at Pahoia School. Police carried out a three-day search but found no sign of him.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Where's Grandad?","released":"2026-11-28T16:09:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:09:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:23:45Z","overview":"65-year-old Alan Gordon Woodford of Bedford St. Mossburn left his home on foot Saturday morning April 20, 1985 and was never seen or heard of again.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder","released":"2026-11-28T17:23:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:23:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:03:45Z","overview":"19-year-old Joan Wech left New Zealand for the bright lights of Sydney. But the first step on her overseas adventure would be her last. Was this a robbery gone wrong, a savage random attack or a revenge killing by a jealous ex-lover?","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: A Mother's Worst Nightmare","released":"2026-11-28T19:03:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:03:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:54:45Z","overview":"Otautau toddler Amber-Lee, aged two and a half, vanished from Kingston at the southern tip of Lake Wakatipu on October 17, 1992.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Last Orders","released":"2026-11-28T19:54:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:54:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:44:45Z","overview":"In 1993, devoted father Kevin O'Loughlin came face to face with the dark side of sunny Nelson when he was brutally stabbed to death after a night out on the town.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Without Warning","released":"2026-11-28T20:44:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:44:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:36:45Z","overview":"This week’s episode of Sensing Murder promises greater co-operation between psychics and police, attempting to uncover the truth about the death of 18-year-old apprentice plumber Regan O’Donoghue, who was killed in a hit and run in 2007.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Vanishing Point","released":"2026-11-28T21:36:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:36:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T22:28:45Z","overview":"In 2003, 32-year-old mother of three Sara Neithe vanished from the Hauraki Plains. Neither Sara nor her car have been seen since. Police suspect that Sara has been murdered but without a crime scene, they have been unable to advance the case.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: The Lie of the Land","released":"2026-11-28T22:28:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T22:28:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:42:45Z","overview":"Sue Nicholson and Deb Webber investigate one of the most complex and intriguing cases ever featured - did Waikato man Jason Dark commit suicide or was he murdered, as his family believes?","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: When The Trail Goes Cold","released":"2026-11-28T23:42:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:42:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:34:45Z","overview":"This episodes involves the disappearance of 62-year-old Kaye Stewart, a woman who went missing while on a short walk on June 13th, 2005.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder: Looking for Justice","released":"2026-11-29T00:34:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:34:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:48:45Z","overview":"This week, for the first time ever, the prime suspect in a murder enquiry has turned to Sensing Murder for help.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder – Live","released":"2026-11-29T01:48:45Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T01:48:45Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder – Live","released":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder – Live","released":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_SensingMurder_us","title":"Sensing Murder – Live","released":"2026-11-2